# Core Architecture

- Build with Next.js App Router + TypeScript and keep modules focused.
- Use clear English names for functions, variables, and file names.
- Prefer small files; split components/services before files become large.
- Keep layering explicit: UI -> validation -> server actions -> data layer.
- Avoid `any`; use proper types/interfaces in `types/`.
